Returns:\n            Dictionary mapping message indices to importance scores 
(0.0-1.0).\n        """\n        if not messages:\n            return {}\n\n    
importance_scores: dict[int, float] = {}\n\n        for i, message in 
enumerate(messages):\n            score = 
